### ==============================================================================
### OMNITRACK LOGISTICS - HTTP REQUEST COLLECTION
### Plataforma de Seguimiento Logístico y Envíos (Fleet & Asset Tracking)
### Colección completa de peticiones de prueba para todos los microservicios
### Autenticación HTTP Basic:
###   Admin -> admin:admin123 (Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=)
###   User  -> user:user123   (Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz)
### ==============================================================================

@fleet_url = http://localhost:8081
@gps_url = http://localhost:8082
@route_url = http://localhost:8083
@alert_url = http://localhost:8084

@admin_auth = Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
@user_auth = Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz


### ==============================================================================
### 1. FLEET-MANAGEMENT-SERVICE (Puerto 8081)
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Actuator Health Check
GET {{fleet_url}}/actuator/health

### 1.2 Swagger UI Docs
GET {{fleet_url}}/v3/api-docs

### 1.3 CRUD DE USUARIOS (Punto Extra #2)
### Listar todos los usuarios
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}

### Obtener usuario por ID
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}

### Obtener usuario por Username
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/users/username/admin
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}

### Crear nuevo usuario (con validación de inputs)
POST {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "supervisor_logistica",
  "password": "PasswordSeguro2026*",
  "email": "supervisor@fleetplatform.com",
  "fullName": "Juan Perez Supervisor",
  "role": "ROLE_USER",
  "active": true
}

### Actualizar usuario
PUT {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "adminNewPassword123",
  "email": "admin_updated@fleetplatform.com",
  "fullName": "Administrador Principal de Plataforma",
  "role": "ROLE_ADMIN",
  "active": true
}

### Eliminar usuario
DELETE {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}


### 1.4 CRUD DE CONDUCTORES (DRIVERS)
### Listar todos los conductores
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/drivers
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Obtener conductor por ID
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/drivers/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Crear conductor
POST {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/drivers
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Fernando Torres",
  "licenseNumber": "LIC-MX-99887",
  "phone": "+525599887766",
  "email": "fernando.torres@fleetplatform.com",
  "active": true
}

### Actualizar conductor
PUT {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/drivers/1
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Carlos Mendez Actualizado",
  "licenseNumber": "LIC-MX-98765",
  "phone": "+525500001111",
  "email": "carlos.mendez.new@fleetplatform.com",
  "active": true
}

### Eliminar conductor
DELETE {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/drivers/2
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}


### 1.5 CRUD DE VEHÍCULOS / ACTIVOS (VEHICLES)
### Listar vehículos (todos)
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Listar vehículos filtrando por estado
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Obtener vehículo por ID
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Crear nuevo vehículo
POST {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vin": "3VW99988877766655",
  "licensePlate": "TRK-9900",
  "brand": "Kenworth",
  "model": "T680 Next Gen",
  "yearManufactured": 2024,
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "capacityKg": 32000.0,
  "assignedDriverId": 1
}

### Actualizar vehículo completo
PUT {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles/1
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vin": "3VW12345678901234",
  "licensePlate": "ABC-1234",
  "brand": "Volvo",
  "model": "FH16 Globetrotter",
  "yearManufactured": 2024,
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "capacityKg": 26000.0,
  "assignedDriverId": 1
}

### Modificar estado operativo (PATCH)
PATCH {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles/1/status?status=MAINTENANCE
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Eliminar vehículo
DELETE {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/vehicles/2
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}


### 1.6 CRUD DE ENVÍOS Y DESPACHOS (SHIPMENTS)
### Listar todos los envíos
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Crear nuevo despacho de carga
POST {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "TRK-2026-9999",
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "originAddress": "Parque Industrial Tlalnepantla, Estado de México",
  "originLatitude": 19.5397,
  "originLongitude": -99.1952,
  "destAddress": "Puerto de Veracruz, Ver.",
  "destLatitude": 19.1738,
  "destLongitude": -96.1342,
  "status": "CREATED"
}

### Obtener envío por ID
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/shipments/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Buscar envío por número de guía (Tracking)
GET {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/shipments/tracking/TRK-2026-0001
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Actualizar estado del despacho
PATCH {{fleet_url}}/api/v1/shipments/1/status?status=DELIVERED
Authorization: {{user_auth}}



### ==============================================================================
### 2. GPS-INGESTION-SERVICE (Puerto 8082)
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Actuator Health Check
GET {{gps_url}}/actuator/health

### 2.2 OpenAPI Docs
GET {{gps_url}}/v3/api-docs

### 2.3 Ingesta individual de telemetría GPS en tiempo real
POST {{gps_url}}/api/v1/telemetry
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "deviceId": "GPS-UNIT-A101",
  "latitude": 19.4501,
  "longitude": -99.1450,
  "altitude": 2245.0,
  "speedKmh": 78.5,
  "heading": 125.0,
  "batteryLevel": 92.0,
  "fuelLevel": 75.0
}

### 2.4 Ingesta masiva en lote (High-Throughput Batch)
POST {{gps_url}}/api/v1/telemetry/batch
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "vehicleId": 1,
      "deviceId": "GPS-UNIT-A101",
      "latitude": 19.4600,
      "longitude": -99.1550,
      "altitude": 2250.0,
      "speedKmh": 82.0,
      "heading": 130.0,
      "batteryLevel": 91.5,
      "fuelLevel": 74.0
    },
    {
      "vehicleId": 1,
      "deviceId": "GPS-UNIT-A101",
      "latitude": 19.4700,
      "longitude": -99.1650,
      "altitude": 2255.0,
      "speedKmh": 85.0,
      "heading": 135.0,
      "batteryLevel": 91.0,
      "fuelLevel": 73.5
    }
  ]
}

### 2.5 Consultar última posición conocida del vehículo
GET {{gps_url}}/api/v1/telemetry/latest/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### 2.6 Consultar historial de coordenadas
GET {{gps_url}}/api/v1/telemetry/history/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### 2.7 Suscribirse al streaming en tiempo real (Server-Sent Events)
GET {{gps_url}}/api/v1/telemetry/stream/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Accept: text/event-stream



### ==============================================================================
### 3. ROUTE-CALCULATION-SERVICE (Puerto 8083)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Actuator Health Check
GET {{route_url}}/actuator/health

### 3.2 OpenAPI Docs
GET {{route_url}}/v3/api-docs

### 3.3 Cálculo de distancia ortodrómica y tiempo estimado de llegada (ETA)
POST {{route_url}}/api/v1/routes/calculate-eta
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "originLatitude": 19.432608,
  "originLongitude": -99.133209,
  "currentLatitude": 19.800000,
  "currentLongitude": -99.500000,
  "destLatitude": 20.659698,
  "destLongitude": -103.349609,
  "currentSpeedKmh": 85.0
}

### 3.4 Consultar historial de cálculos de ruta del vehículo
GET {{route_url}}/api/v1/routes/history/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### 3.5 CRUD de Geocercas (Geofencing)
### Listar todas las geocercas
GET {{route_url}}/api/v1/geofences
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Crear nueva geocerca
POST {{route_url}}/api/v1/geofences
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Parque Industrial San Martin Obispo",
  "description": "Centro logístico y patio de maniobras",
  "centerLatitude": 19.6050,
  "centerLongitude": -99.2310,
  "radiusMeters": 3500.0,
  "active": true,
  "vehicleId": 1
}

### Obtener geocerca por ID
GET {{route_url}}/api/v1/geofences/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Actualizar geocerca
PUT {{route_url}}/api/v1/geofences/1
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zona Metropolitana CDMX Ampliada",
  "description": "Perímetro expandido para transportes de carga",
  "centerLatitude": 19.432608,
  "centerLongitude": -99.133209,
  "radiusMeters": 25000.0,
  "active": true,
  "vehicleId": 1
}

### Eliminar geocerca
DELETE {{route_url}}/api/v1/geofences/2
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}

### 3.6 Verificar si una coordenada está DENTRO o FUERA de la geocerca
POST {{route_url}}/api/v1/geofences/check
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceId": 1,
  "latitude": 19.440000,
  "longitude": -99.140000
}



### ==============================================================================
### 4. ALERT-SERVICE (Puerto 8084)
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Actuator Health Check
GET {{alert_url}}/actuator/health

### 4.2 OpenAPI Docs
GET {{alert_url}}/v3/api-docs

### 4.3 Listar todas las alertas
GET {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Listar alertas filtradas por resolución
GET {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts?resolved=false
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Listar alertas filtradas por severidad
GET {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts?severity=HIGH
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Obtener alerta por ID
GET {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Consultar alertas de un vehículo específico
GET {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts/vehicle/1
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Crear alerta manualmente
POST {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "alertType": "PANIC_BUTTON",
  "severity": "CRITICAL",
  "message": "Activación de botón de pánico de emergencia por conductor",
  "latitude": 19.4326,
  "longitude": -99.1332,
  "currentValue": 1.0,
  "thresholdValue": 0.0
}

### Resolver alerta
PATCH {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts/1/resolve
Authorization: {{user_auth}}

### Eliminar alerta
DELETE {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts/2
Authorization: {{admin_auth}}

### 4.4 Evaluación automática de reporte de telemetría (detección de anomalías)
POST {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts/evaluate-telemetry
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "speedKmh": 118.4,
  "latitude": 19.4500,
  "longitude": -99.1500,
  "batteryLevel": 11.2,
  "fuelLevel": 8.0,
  "panicButtonPressed": false
}

### 4.5 Streaming reactivo de alertas (Server-Sent Events)
GET {{alert_url}}/api/v1/alerts/stream
Authorization: {{user_auth}}
Accept: text/event-stream
